  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e5c364ea64bdf614b9dda1453a961805, type: 3}
  m_Name: Week2_Mission9_Dialogue_9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Ms. Kie
  speechLines:
  - ...
  - Fine. Let us put that to the ultimate test.
  - 'What we have here are secubots. '
  - If any of them see them, it is puzzle time for them.
  - 'All they have to do is to scout this area and look for bombs. '
  - Each bomb will give you a puzzle to complete.
  - It could be a puzzle in fixing it, reprogramming it, or both.
  - 'The true test: if any puzzle was failed, they automatically fail this test.'
  - Whenever you are ready, dear.
